  title: "The Vega Casket"
  fullText: "Half-buried in the moss lies a casket of elven make, its seams humming with a cold blue light. Faded runes along the lid read: Property of the Vega Unit. Whatever slumbers inside was never meant for human hands.\n\nWhat will you do?"
